        <mxCell id="3xYGQPMeSW1f0xWLX_ws-21" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#000000;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;When the user logins they will automatically see the dashboard.&amp;nbsp; The dashboard shows their current trip which is determined by the last trip that was clicked on or the most recently added trip.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;The user can click the hamburger nav bar to view &#39;Dashboard&#39;, &#39;All Trips&#39;, &#39;Add Trip&#39;, and &#39;Leave a Review&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;On the Dashboard page they can &#39;Add Expense&#39;, &#39;View Expenses&#39;, &#39;Edit Trip&#39;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 127, 255);&quot;&gt;Shauna will start out on the login page, then go to her dashboard where she can immediately see her current trip and budget with categorical breakdown. She can then view all her logged expenses by clicking on the button to view expenses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
